OL,3,GNEWSAResidents feel 'caged' by years of
OL,4,Ascaffolding works
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living inside a landmark
OL,7,FManchester apartment block say they
OL,8,Fhave been living in darkness because
OL,9,Fthe building has been wrapped in
OL,10,Fscaffolding for much of the last six
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FIndia House in Whitworth Street, where
OL,14,FNoel Gallagher wrote some of Oasis's
OL,15,Fmost famous songs during his time
OL,16,Fliving there, is encased in scaffolding
OL,17,Fand wrapped in thick plastic.
OL,19,FSome residents told the Local Democracy
OL,20,FReporting Service that they had to
OL,21,Fleave their lights on all day because
OL,22,Flittle light could get in.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
