OL,3,GNEWSAResidents feel 'caged' by years of
OL,4,Ascaffolding works
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Guinness Partnership, which runs
OL,7,Fthe building, said there had been
OL,8,Fongoing works on the roof, and that it
OL,9,Fhad previously paid out compensation to
OL,10,Fsome tenants to help with heating
OL,11,Fcosts.
